        \li Bare cross-module link: \l UpstreamButton.
        \li Link to the upstream landing page: \l {Upstream Widgets}.
    \endlist

    This page is also a member of the cross-module \\ingroup
    \l {Upstream Controls} group, so that the consumer's "is part of"
    listing exercises the merge path that copies status from the
    upstream's group definition.
*/
